# Input
```css
/* should not generate diagnostics */
.a {
    @if $theme == dark {
        color: white;
    } @else if $theme == light {
        color: black;
    } @else {
        color: gray;
    }
}

.a {
    .b {
        @include button;
        @extend %placeholder;
        color: red;
    }
}

@mixin theme {
    .a {
        .b {
            color: red;
        }
    }
}

@function double($value) {
    @if $value {
        @return $value * 2;
    } @else {
        @return 0;
    }
}

@each $name in $names {
    .icon-#{$name} {
        &:hover {
            color: red;
        }
    }
}

```
